ch to the key component's color. Preserve the key and all unrelated cells. Do not select incidental exact shape matches, such as dimers, without evidence that they are designated by the key pattern. Verified recurrence: the upper-right color-5 L enclosed a one-cell color-3 reference at row 0, column 19; the matching isolated color-3 cell at row 18, column 16 was recolored to 5. The accepted output changed only that target cell. Earlier guesses recoloring incidental dimers were incorrect.","path":"general","scope":"global","reference":{},"arguments":{},"metadata":{"scope":"global","evidence":"accepted test recurrence; earlier incidental-dimer guesses rejected"},"source":"refine","created_at":"2026-09-29T13:36:27.665Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T13:55:29.346Z","version":2},"applied":true}],"harnessStatePath":"/home/ubuntu/continual-arc-baselines/.workbench/runs/adhoc-primeagentlearner-1790682293/attempts/52117ae0ff214dc5897fae72cc93757c/system/state/agent/harness/harness_state.json","scope":"global"}
