{"id":"refine_20260929143141242","summary":"Create a global memory for the verified one-row downward translation rule in Continual-ARC task-4ab2c35c.","rationale":"Two demonstrations and one correctly solved test confirm that every non-background cell moves down exactly one row, with fixed grid dimensions and clipping at the bottom edge.","expectedOutcome":"On recurrence, preserve the background and grid dimensions, leave the top row as background, shift all other content down one row, and validate that cells moving past the bottom are clipped rather than expanding the grid.","appliedEdits":[{"action":"create","kind":"memory","id":"continual_arc_task_4ab2c35c_shift_foreground_down_one_row","title":"Continual-ARC task-4ab2c35c: shift foreground down one row","content":"Global verified rule for Continual-ARC task-4ab2c35c, confirmed by two demonstrations and one correctly solved test. Identify the uniform background and translate every non-background cell down exactly one row. Preserve the grid dimensions and background; the top row becomes background, and any colored cell shifted below the bottom edge is clipped. Colors and foreground patterns may vary. Do not expand the grid.","metadata":{"scope":"global","evidence":"Two demonstrations and one accepted test"},"reason":"Records the demonstrated, reusable transformation and its fixed-size clipping behavior.","after":{"id":"continual_arc_task_4ab2c35c_shift_foreground_down_one_row","kind":"memory","title":"Continual-ARC task-4ab2c35c: shift foreground down one row","content":"Global verified rule for Continual-ARC task-4ab2c35c, confirmed by two demonstrations and one correctly solved test. Identify the uniform background and translate every non-background cell down exactly one row. Preserve the grid dimensions and background; the top row becomes background, and any colored cell shifted below the bottom edge is clipped. Colors and foreground patterns may vary. Do not expand the grid.","path":"general","scope":"global",